        "id": "9c7c864a907f4c0247ff57e7"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The last [[DM.Factions[faction_HarbingersOfDoom],Harbinger]] JumpShip has left the Coromodir system.\n\nAs for the remaining [[DM.Factions[faction_TortugaPirates],Kittens]] and the <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBadKitty],Bad Kitty]]</i>, they disappeared shortly after Murray did her final crazy act.",
