    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c4b21163421c6a3dccd3c41"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I saw from my disabled 'Mech the Harbingers recovering her ejection pod and have been wondering about what her true motives were.\n\nShe always claimed she wanted revenge for [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreTortugaCity],Tortuga City]] but here she prevented me from detonating the nuke and allowed herself to be captured by them.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 2,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c4f54fb684a255b258f8278"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": {
        "ops": [
          {
            "functionName": "Set BattleTech Camera Lock",
            "args": [
              {
                "int_value": 0,
                "bool_value": false,
                "float_value": 0.0,
                "string_value": "AUTO",
                "call_value": null,
                "variableref_value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c269719217868ea32b0a3aa"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It was astonishing, how they simply stopped their attack on our world and just boarded their DropShips and left, ignoring your deactivated <i>Kintaro</i> and the Commander's <i>Phoenix Hawk</i>.\n\nHer challenge and surrender made them stop their raid and leave the system.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "But why?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c5ab6944d5cda622fd18eb6"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c87382f44f43f0cc75255fb"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Captain Murray might have gained some hidden knowledge somewhere regarding these Periphery raiders and used it.\n\nBut they must have also known about the atomic warhead on my <i>Kintaro</i> and decided not to take the risk that we would use it.\n",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Any idea on what 'I am ilChi' might mean?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c08ac3d215bc39cc677b4b0"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cdfd7c535ed6c485c952cd2"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "I have done a search through the <i>Argo</i>'s records and whatever sources I could find, and there is no reference to the term she used to address the Harbingers.\n\nPlus with Kitten's heavy accent I am not even sure of how it's spelled, 'ilKee', ilKhi', in my opinion this is just some pirate lingo.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c161f2efc8d21994e3f5a07"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca9a2e01b8fa025d357647a"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Despite that mystery of Murray's true motives and identity, the part that matters now is that we won, the Harbingers have retreated and the Restoration is safe.\n\nPerhaps now we can finally have peace.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cd34e2dc2b9da6a7808a889"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca76e8878cf6de0e49f775e"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Until the [[DM.Factions[faction_Davion],Federated Suns]] decide to conquer the Periphery after they take the [[DM.Factions[faction_Liao],Capellan Confederation]].\n\nOnce the predators start smelling blood, there's no way to stop to the killing.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c01b7e6216996546b633490"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
