      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": {
        "ops": [
          {
            "functionName": "Set BattleTech Camera Lock",
            "args": [
              {
                "int_value": 0,
                "bool_value": false,
                "float_value": 0.0,
                "string_value": "AUTO",
                "call_value": null,
                "variableref_value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce066510547dc6815a55d2b"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Most of what happened since my exile and until today will have to be hidden, including from [[DM.Factions[faction_InterstellarExpeditions],Interstellar Expeditions]] and even [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreChandrasekharKurita],'Bob']].\n\nOtherwise we risk prying eyes and soon greedy hands of everyone in the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreInnerSphere],Inner Sphere]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "You can do this?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c347998f62db1b39be9bfcc"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9a01873f100b11d5740ec7"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I am from [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHouseMadeira],House Madeira]] and we have been writing the history of the Reach since the days of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAuriganTradePartnership],Aurigan Trade Partnership]].\n\nEvents can't truly be forgotten but they can be adapted into a different narrative, which shall be promoted as the official story.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb68ccd56c45190b08c51b4"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5561e7d92e0f0344c6c008"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "History is written accordingly by the victors, Commander.\n\nThat might be our only true reward for all the pain and all the losses.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
